{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52800","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 梁涉","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尚道遗朝绂，从天降羽衣。\n储安四皓去，荣足二疏归。\n垂耀珠随转，驰轩鹤送飞。\n轻舟镜湖上，宸翰作光辉。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}